<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Walter on Typophile Archive</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/walter/</link><description>Recent content in Walter on Typophile Archive</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 10 Feb 2008 18:49:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/walter/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Letters of Credit</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/41912/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 Feb 2008 18:49:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/41912/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Indices"&gt;Indices&lt;/a&gt; : &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Publications"&gt;Publications&lt;/a&gt; : Letters of Credit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
By &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Walter%20Tracy"&gt;Walter Tracy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
First published in 1986.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/www.amazon.com/dp/1567922406/typophile-20"&gt;Buy it&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By no means complete, it is still one of the best books that analyzes typefaces and type design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first half of the book deals with type measurement, legibility &amp;amp; readibility, type making from metal to film to 1980&amp;rsquo;s technology, many aspects of proportion and letterforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The second half looks at Designers of Type: &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Jan%20van%20Krimpen"&gt;Jan van Krimpen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Frederic%20W.%20Goudy"&gt;Frederic W. Goudy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Rudolf%20Koch"&gt;Rudolf Koch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/W.A.%20Dwiggins"&gt;W.A. Dwiggins&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150129011056/http:/typophile.com/wiki/Stanley%20Morison"&gt;Stanley Morison&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>